                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " depends entirely on "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wok hei ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "wok-hei"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Cook it in single portions over the highest heat you have. This is not a dish that works well when doubled in the same pan. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The noodles should be fresh flat rice noodles at room temperature. Cold noodles from the fridge will drop the wok temperature and prevent the char from forming."
          }
        ]
      },
